<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-052" chapter-id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses" source-id="s-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses-ws2190655">
  <p id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAC">褚叔度</persName>，河南陽翟人也。曾祖<persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0013" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">裒</persName>，晉太傅。祖<persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0020" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAA">歆</persName>，祕書監。父<persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p001:m0027" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">爽</persName>，金紫光祿大夫。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAC">叔度</persName>第二子<persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0005" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAACA">寂之</persName>，著作佐郎，早卒。子<persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0017" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAACAA">曖</persName>，尚太祖第六女<persName id="c-songshu-052-chuai-family-clauses:p002:m0025" ref="3bh_k4m_fg4_D">琅邪貞長公主</persName>，太宰參軍，亦早卒。</p>
</text>
